OL,3,GNEWSAGun used by MI5's first female
OL,4,Aagent handler sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wartime pistol once owned by the MI5
OL,7,Fagent handler Mary Sherer has sold at
OL,8,Fauction for #1,600 - more than four
OL,9,Ftimes its estimate.
OL,11,FSherer, thought to be the first female
OL,12,Fagent handler in the Security Service,
OL,13,Fwas instrumental in the World War Two
OL,14,Foperation "Double Cross" which used a
OL,15,Fstable of double agents to supply the
OL,16,FNazis with false information ahead of
OL,17,FD-Day.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
