OL,3,GNEWSAGun used by MI5's first female
OL,4,Aagent handler sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the most challenging double
OL,7,Fagents she handled was a French woman
OL,8,Fcodenamed Agent Treasure, who had
OL,9,Fthreatened to end her bogus reports to
OL,10,Fthe Germans a month before D-Day -
OL,11,Fbefore she changed her mind.
OL,13,FDiscovered at a valuation day in
OL,14,FGloucestershire, the Mauser C96 was
OL,15,Fonly estimated to fetch between #300
OL,16,Fand #500.
